OL,3,GNEWSAScrapped bypass raises concern
OL,4,Aover housing plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has said plans for a
OL,7,Fbypass in Derbyshire were scrapped
OL,8,Fbecause it did not offer enough value
OL,9,Ffor money for the taxpayer.
OL,11,FThe Department for Transport (DfT) has
OL,12,Fformally cancelled the #197m
OL,13,FChesterfield-Staveley Regeneration
OL,14,FRoute which aimed to improve links
OL,15,Fbetween the two towns and open up space
OL,16,Ffor thousands of homes.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
