OL,3,GNEWSAScrapped bypass raises concern
OL,4,Aover housing plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FTown councillors in Staveley are now
OL,7,Fcalling on Chesterfield Borough Council
OL,8,Fto halt future housing projects in the
OL,9,Farea until the bypass - which was first
OL,10,Fmooted in the 1950s - is revised and
OL,11,Fbuilt.
OL,13,FCouncillor Paul Mann said: "Staveley
OL,14,FTown Council, as a consultee, should
OL,15,Fobject to all future housing
OL,16,Fdevelopment due to a poor inadequate
OL,17,Froad infrastructure."
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
